{"id":"merui","nameZh":"天守","nameEn":"merui","star":"E","author":"UP","category":"机甲类-E","categoryLabel":"机甲（埃里克尔）","tier":1,"unitClass":"ErekirUnitType","isSubUnit":false,"packs":["UP的埃里克尔单位&建筑补丁整合包.hjson","UP的埃里克尔单位补丁包.hjson","UT和UP的S&E星单位补丁合集.hjson"],"description":"轻型光束机甲。T1级机甲类单位，拥有轻型装甲，可以跨越大多数地形，攻击方式为从炮口射出光束持续灼烧敌人装甲，面对无护甲单位时表现优秀。\n经过我们的重新设计，天守的攻击模式被彻底颠覆。我们拆除了原先的火炮装置，换装了一门持续照射型光束发生器，这道淡紫色光束能精准锁定并灼烧任何被照准的敌人，在对抗缺乏装甲防护的低级单位时表现尤为出色。\n然而，正常光束的预热机制导致其初期伤害较低，需要一段时间才能达到峰值输出，为此，我们的工程师降低了光束发生器的功率，换取了机动性方面的提升，使其能在战场前沿灵活穿梭。","stats":{"health":600,"armor":4.0,"speed":0.95,"hitSize":9.0,"range":160,"maxRange":160,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true,"fogRadius":null,"payloadCapacity":null},"vanillaStats":{"health":680.0,"armor":4.0,"speed":0.72,"hitSize":9.0,"range":null,"maxRange":null},"dps":{"direct":114.0,"splash":514.29,"total":628.29,"air":114.0,"ground":114.0,"suicide":false,"targetAir":true,"targetGround":true},"vanillaDps":{"direct":38.1,"splash":28.57,"total":66.67,"air":0.0,"ground":38.1},"weapons":[{"name":"merui-laser","weaponType":"Weapon","role":"damage","bulletType":"PointLaserBulletType","mode":"continuous","reload":3.5,"reloadSec":0.058,"reloadExplicit":true,"shots":1,"shotDelay":0.0,"firstShotDelay":0.0,"damage":9.5,"splashDamage":30.0,"splashDamageRadius":19.0,"perShotDirect":9.5,"perShotSplash":30.0,"fragBullets":0,"fragDirect":0.0,"fragSplash":0.0,"dps":114.0,"perShot":9.5,"splashDps":514.29,"collidesAir":true,"collidesGround":true,"bulletRange":138.0,"continuous":true,"canHitAir":true,"canHitGround":true}],"abilities":[],"parts":[],"description_en":null,"raw":{"weapons":[{"__type":"Weapon","__args":["\"merui-weapon\""],"name":"merui-laser","shootSound":"shootLaser","mirror":false,"showStatSprite":false,"x":0,"y":0,"shootY":2,"reload":3.5,"cooldownTime":42.0,"bullet":{"__type":"ArtilleryBulletType","__args":["3f"," 40"],"shootEffect":"none","collidesTiles":true,"frontColor":"Color.white","knockback":0.8,"lifetime":46.0,"splashDamageRadius":19.0,"splashDa